    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Merge API allows businesses to seamlessly combine multiple shopping carts into a single unified cart. This operation is essential for enhancing customer experience, particularly when users switch between devices or sessions. By merging carts, retailers can ensure that customers retain their selected products and complete their purchases without losing items. Typical consumers of this API include online retailers and backend systems that manage customer shopping experiences. This endpoint streamlines the checkout process, making it more efficient and customer-friendly.",
